{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"43ab48cf-f693-4f4a-a82f-53e422c6b992","agentId":"a3513cfdc5825aff0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Repo: C:\\Users\\olive_\\OneDrive\\Documentos\\codigo\\Momma\\momma-stock-insight\n\nTASK: Regenerate the Supabase TypeScript types file to match the current remote schema, then verify the build.\n\nSteps:\n1. Load the MCP tool by calling ToolSearch with query: `select:mcp__supabase-mcp-server__generate_typescript_types`\n2. Call `mcp__supabase-mcp-server__generate_typescript_types` (no special params needed; it targets the connected project). The result is the full contents of the types file. If the tool result is saved to a file due to size, read that file fully (slice by char ranges if lines are long) to obtain the complete TypeScript content.\n3. Write that content VERBATIM to: src/integrations/supabase/types.ts  (overwrite the existing file completely with the freshly generated content — do not hand-edit it).\n4. Run `npx tsc --noEmit` from the repo root.\n\nThen VERIFY the regenerated file no longer contains these (they were dropped/archived from the DB):\n- the string `codigo_barras` (should be GONE)\n- table defs for: motoristas, rotas, corridas_ativas, sessoes_motorista, localizacoes_corrida, localizacoes_tempo_real, eventos_proximidade (should be GONE)\n- table defs for: backup_reset_fab_20260529_estoque, backup_reset_fab_20260529_estoque_lotes, backup_reset_fab_20260529_etiquetas (should be GONE from the public schema types)\nUse grep on src/integrations/supabase/types.ts to confirm each is absent.\n\nREPORT back: the tsc exit code, and the grep confirmation (present/absent) for `codigo_barras` and each table name above. If tsc fails, paste the errors. Do not change any other files."},"uuid":"32d20602-e0c3-4242-a4e8-167f29d0393e","timestamp":"2026-06-03T16:23:36.868Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\olive_\\OneDrive\\Documentos\\codigo\\Momma\\momma-stock-insight"